 "scope": "Text-token rates from the flagship tables (Standard, Batch, Flex, Fast, Ultrafast) and the ChatGPT, Codex and Search rows of the specialized table. Audio, image, realtime, embedding, fine-tuning, cyber, life-sciences and legal tables are not included.",
