 },
 "rules": [
  "Short context: <=272K input tokens. Long context: >272K input tokens. (pricing page)",
  "A price of null means the page shows '-' for that model, tier and category.",
  "context_pricing 'flat': the page lists one rate with no short/long split; it is applied to every request length.",
  "Cache-write pricing is not an additive fee: input tokens use the uncached-input, cached-input, or cache-write rate. (prompt caching guide)",
  "GPT-5.5 and earlier: no additional cache-write charge. (prompt caching guide)",
  "Reasoning tokens are billed as output tokens; cached tokens are included in input_tokens and reasoning tokens in output_tokens. (Agents API observability guide)",
  "Priority processing was renamed Fast mode on July 30, 2026; a response shows service_tier=priority for Fast. (pricing page, API reference)",
  "Regional processing (data residency) and FedRAMP endpoints are charged a 10% uplift for models released on or after March 5, 2026. Not applied by the tool: it is not visible in usage. (pricing page)",
  "Tokens used by built-in tools are billed at the model's token rates; per-call tool fees and container sessions are separate and not included. (pricing page)"
 ],
